  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable food production for poverty reduction in Rwanda-Concern Worldwide</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Description&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The global objective of this action is to strengthen food security and nutrition in Rwanda.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of this action is to promote food production from socially and environmentally sustainable agriculture in Gisagara and Nyaruguru district&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The priorities of this action are to improve the knowledge and skills of farmers in sustainable land husbandry, Climate Smart Agriculture (CSA), and agroforestry; to increase the access to local markets and financial resources for farmers; to enhance the community knowledge on good nutrition practices within the households. &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
